</a></td>\n                    </tr> </table><p>[2026-07-06 12:46:12] &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;CI执行结束 </p>","created_at":"2026-07-06T12:46:08+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-06T12:46:12+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":178689710,"discussion_id":"77bc06b19e50ba6a0a22a73aae15e9e5473cde80","body":"#### 变更摘要\n\n此 PR 将 `MatmulAllReduce` 中 int8 低比特通信的集合通信原语从 `ReduceScatter`+`AllGather` 组合改为 `AlltoAll`+`AllGather` 组合，同时将后处理从 `MatmulAllReduceQuantMulCast`（量化乘+类型转换）替换为 `MatmulAllReduceQuantReduceSum`（跨卡求和+缩放量化）。核心目的是适配 int8 低比特场景下的通信与计算流程优化，精简 workspace 布局并引入新的 reduce sum 算子。\n\n**主要改动**\n\n- **通信原语变更**：在 `matmul_all_reduce_quant_comm_int8.h` 和 `matmul_all_reduce_quant_pertoken_comm_int8.h` 中，将 `ReduceScatter` 调用替换为 `AlltoAll`，相关变量命名（如 `reduceScatterInGM_`→`all2allInGM_`、`reduceScatterHandleId_`→`all2allHandleId_`、`reduceScatterCommitIdx_`→`all2allCommitIdx_` 等）全面更新，通信下发逻辑（Handle 创建、Commit/Wait）同步适配。\n\n- **Workspace 布局简化**：原方案需要 `reduceScatterInGM_`、`allGatherInGM_`、`allGatherOutGM_`、`reduceScatterOutGM_` 四块 buffer，现改为 `all2allInGM_`、`all2allOutGM_`、`allGatherOutGM_` 三块 — `all2allOutGM_` 同时作为 AlltoAll 输出和 AllGather 输入，减少了对 `commFp32WorkSpace` 的依赖，相应地 tiling 文件中的 workspace 计算也去除了 `commFp32WorkSpace` 项。\n\n- **新增 `MatmulAllReduceQuantReduceSum` 算子**：新增 `matmul_all_reduce_quant_reduce_sum.h`，实现 int8 AlltoAll 输出的跨卡求和与缩放量化流程（int8→fp16→fp32→跨卡 Add→×scale_ratio→fp32→fp16→int8），支持仅切 M 和同时切 MN 两种分核策略，取代原先的 `MatmulAllReduceQuantMulCastCommInt8` 调用。\n\n- **Tiling 配置适配**：在 `quant_matmul_all_reduce_tiling_950.cpp` 中，当 `isInputCommQuantScale==1` 时，通信配置方法从 `SetMc2HcommRSAG` 改为 `SetMc2HcommTwoShot`，并显式传入 `DT_INT8` 数据类型。\n\n- **核间调度收敛**：在两个 kernel 文件中引入 `notifyFlag_` 成员变量，仅 `GetBlockIdx()==0` 且 `CoreType==AIV` 时置为 true，所有通信的 Commit/Wait/Finalize 操作均受 `notifyFlag_` 保护，确保仅通知核参与 HCCL 任务调度。\n\n","created_at":"2026-07-06T13:40:12+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-06T13:40:12+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":178737177,"discussion_id":"869c29cd74ce375baae747b2ee60276b9fe9740d","body":"/approve","created_at":"2026-07-06T16:37:17+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-06T16:37:17+08:00","user":{"id":"68d502180329437872e54496","login":"gcw_kUomxQ2l","object_id":"68d502180329437872e54496","name":"liulun0308","avatar_url":"","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/gcw_kUomxQ2l"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":178780177,"discussion_id":"66ce0d0146df406c72c9ff8f422856d92a683c64","body":"/lgtm\n/approve","created_at":"2026-07-06T19:46:50+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-06T19:46:50+08:00","user":{"id":"6877715d70f8532fca319fe9","login":"liudan12","object_id":"6877715d70f8532fca319fe9","name":"liudan12","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/liudan12"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"}]